      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are carrying such a heavy burden; your feelings of being overwhelmed and disconnected are incredibly valid, and you are not alone in experiencing this. Remember that just as you expect yourself to need rest, you are allowed to pause, step away from the machines of daily routine, and reach out to a trusted friend or a mental health professional who can assist. Healing often begins with recognizing that needing support to breathe through these storms is a sign of courage, not weakness.",
